          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "неделя (nedélya) is не, \"not\", with дело, \"work\": first \"the day of no work\", Sunday, and then the week that runs from it (Vasmer). Vasmer thinks it most likely copies Latin fēria, \"holiday\"."
            }
          ]
        },
